<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>HTML on FreeBSD Documentation Portal</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/tags/HTML/</link><description>Recent content in HTML on FreeBSD Documentation Portal</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>BSD 2-clause 'Simplified' License</copyright><atom:link href="https://docs.freebsd.org/en/tags/HTML/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Chapter 14. Trademarks</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/trademarks/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/trademarks/</guid><description>&lt;div id="preamble"&gt;
&lt;div class="sectionbody"&gt;

&lt;div class="paragraph"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For all documents on the FreeBSD Documentation Project, citing registered trademarks is necessary and other trademarks is customary, and that is a requirement for every writer and contributor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sect1"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="trademark-symbols"&gt;14.1. Trademark Symbols&lt;a class="anchor" href="#trademark-symbols"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="sectionbody"&gt;
&lt;div class="paragraph"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Append a trademark symbol (™, ®, or other) to the first occurrence of the trademarked name, and always when using logos.
Use the &lt;a href="https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer//writing-style/#writing-style-special-characters"&gt;equivalent ASCII sequence&lt;/a&gt;, which will be rendered as the actual Unicode character.
Also, write the trademarked name following its trademark guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chapter 15. See Also</title><link>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/see-also/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/fdp-primer/see-also/</guid><description>&lt;div id="preamble"&gt;
